1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,031
The couple have no complaints.

2
00:00:02,031 --> 00:00:08,645
With the money they build a two storey mansion, with iron bars on the windows so that angels can't get in.

3
00:00:08,645 --> 00:00:14,179
Pelayo gives up his job and keeps rabbits; Elisenda buys satin shoes.

4
00:00:14,179 --> 00:00:20,156
The child grows up and plays in the rotting coop, and he and the angel catch chicken pox together.

5
00:00:20,156 --> 00:00:31,250
The doctor who listens to the angel's chest finds so many noises he seems impossible alive, but the wings look so natural that the doctor wonders why other men don't have them.

